      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": "The Last Death of the Year",
    "type": "Novel",
    "character": "Hercule Poirot",
    "year": 2025,
    "url": "https://www.agathachristie.com/stories/the-last-death-of-the-year",
    "cover": "https://agathachristie.imgix.net/hcus-paperback/Jacket_TheLastDeathOfTheYearUS.jpg",
    "synopsis": "The brilliant Belgian detective rings in the New Year with a chilling murder investigation on a Greek island in this all-new mystery from Sophie Hannah, author of Hercule Poirot’s Silent Night.",
    "moreAbout": "New Year's Eve, 1932.\n\nHercule Poirot and his good friend Inspector Edward Catchpool arrive on the Greek island of Lamperos for a little holiday…or is it?\n\nCatchpool suspects Poirot has a different reason for being there ― one he won't reveal. As the clock ticks towards the New Year and a festive guessing game takes a sinister turn, can Poirot stop a murderer who is determined to strike before midnight?",
    "trivia": [],
