  {
    "title": "Murder at the Grand Alpine Hotel",
    "type": "Novel",
    "character": "Miss Marple",
    "year": 2026,
    "url": "https://www.agathachristie.com/stories/murder-at-the-grand-alpine-hotel",
    "cover": "https://agathachristie.imgix.net/image-store/Jacket_MurderattheGrandAlpineHotel.jpg",
    "synopsis": "A brand new Miss Marple novel from Lucy Foley, the No.1 bestselling author of The Guest List and The Midnight Feast",
    "moreAbout": "On a rare holiday abroad, Miss Marple is enjoying the refined luxury of the Grand Alpine Hotel: a stunning winter playground, high in the Swiss Alps. But when someone is found dead, and a snowstorm descends, it falls to Marple to decipher the most chilling of mysteries…\n\nThe most famous fictional female detective of all time returns in Lucy Foley’s Murder at the Grand Alpine Hotel. Publishing September 8 2026.\n\nRRP: $30.00, £22.00",
    "trivia": [],
    "quote": null,
