  {
    "title": "Midsummer Mysteries",
    "type": "Collection",
    "character": "Hercule Poirot",
    "year": 2021,
    "url": "https://www.agathachristie.com/stories/midsummer-mysteries",
    "cover": "https://agathachristie.imgix.net/hcus-paperback/Midsummer-Mysteries.jpg",
    "synopsis": "A collection of summer-themed mysteries from the master of the genre\n\nSummertime – as the temperature rises, so does the potential for evil. From Cornwall to the French Riviera, whether against a background of Delphic temples or English country houses, Agatha Christie’s most famous characters solve even the most devilish of conundrums as the summer sun beats down. Pull up a deckchair and enjoy plot twists and red herrings galore from the bestselling fiction writer of all time. This new collection of stories features mysteries starring Miss Marple, Hercule Poirot, Parker Pyne and Mr Harley Quin.",
    "moreAbout": null,
    "trivia": [],
    "quote": {
      "text": "In spite of himself Mr Satterthwaite shivered a little. The afternoon, he thought, must be growing chilly. And yet the sun seemed as bright as ever.",
      "author": "'Harlequin's Lane', Agatha Christie"
    },
    "extractPdf": "https://agathachristie.imgix.net/image-store/Read-Christie-2024/ACL_PoirotList_2024.pdf",
    "related": [
      {
