    "synopsis": "A small cast, short version of an intricate psychological thriller taken from Philomel Cottage.",
    "moreAbout": "Enid rejects her fiancé for newcomer Gerald and moves to a remote country cottage with him – where a dark and terrible climax takes place.\n\nAgatha Christie wrote this play some years before going to work with Frank Vosper on Love From A Stranger, a stage adaptation of the same story.",
    "trivia": [],
