    "synopsis": "A short, small cast Poirot story.",
    "moreAbout": "This classic Christie short story sees Hercule Poirot come between a bitter triangle of lovers to prevent a sinister murder before it takes place.\n\nThis is the only story Christie herself adapted for television – it appeared on the BBC in June 1937 and a reviewer said it was \" excellently done\". It is now available for live stage performance.",
