    "cover": "https://agathachristie.imgix.net/hcuk-paperback/golden-ball-other-stories-agatha-christie-paperback-cover-art.jpg",
    "synopsis": "Down on her luck and living with family in a boarding house, Mrs St Vincent comes across an advert to rent a beautiful house with a benevolent landlord. From The Listerdale Mystery.",
    "moreAbout": "The story was first published in a collection in June 1934, under The Listerdale Mystery. It was not published in the US until the 1971 collection The Golden Ball and Other Stories.",
